@startuml
actor Operator
participant MarsColony
participant Environment
participant ExplorationMission

Operator -> MarsColony : submitMission(exploration)
MarsColony -> MarsColony : check no active mission
MarsColony -> ExplorationMission : validateRequirements(colony, environment)
ExplorationMission -> Environment : isDustStorm()
Environment --> ExplorationMission : true (DUST_STORM)
ExplorationMission -> ExplorationMission : set failureReason
ExplorationMission --> MarsColony : false
MarsColony -> ExplorationMission : fail(failureReason)
note right of ExplorationMission : State becomes FAILED immediately.
No agent is locked and the mission never becomes active.
MarsColony --> Operator : submission rejected
@enduml
